    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like there's no point in pretending. i'm still here physically but the version of me that actually mattered to people is just... gone. it feels less like being lonely and more like i'm just a glitch in the system. like i'm just taking up space that doesn't belong to me anymore.",
