    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know people say that but it doesn't change the reality. the void is already here. it’s like i’m a shadow of a person and i’m just waiting for the rest of me to catch up to the fact that i'm already gone. if i'm already a ghost, why do i have to keep doing the whole \"being alive\" thing? it feels so exhausting and pointless.",
